    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1152">

                <pb facs="1003" n="899" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg899"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 81.2.00/9952.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Consul at Ciudad Juárez to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso, Texas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>No reliable news from Chihuahua City, but the general impression is that it will
                    fall into the hands of the rebels without battle.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwards</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
